From d5d43af73a3c64bb3e6522964e2d54fbf8077149 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BaresipKit <baresipkit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:15:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ice: support ICE restart

Add an optional restart hook to struct mnat. call_reset_transp() uses it
when the media NAT supports it, so a network change restarts ICE with new
credentials and fresh candidates instead of re-INVITEing stale ones. The
re-INVITE is sent once gathering completes. A remote offer with a new
ice-ufrag restarts ICE on the answering side, reusing its gathered
candidates so the answer is complete.
---
 include/baresip.h |   4 +
 modules/ice/ice.c | 319 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 src/call.c        |  25 ++++
 3 files changed, 325 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

